  "note": "2.6.2 keeps the 2.6.1 engine, storage, Review and LAB/APP presentation routing. It fixes PWA freshness: after a complete offline package installs, the worker activates and claims the LAB scope without forcing a page reload. Desktop PWA starts in LAB; phone/native uses APP presentation. The client also requests an explicit registration.update() on launch so future releases are not left to throttled browser update checks."
